BEGIN:VCALENDAR
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fall Dance Camp Weekend
DTSTART:20261010T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:A full weekend of contras\, squares and English country dancing with live music from three different bands and callers from across the region. Beginner workshops run all day Saturday before the evening dance\, and there is a potluck lunch on Sunday where everyone brings a dish to share before the final afternoon session wraps up the weekend for another year.
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
